WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.697
Jeffrey the Giant had many friends.

2
00:00:12.698 --> 00:00:17.431
Everyone liked Jeffrey because he was so kind.

3
00:00:17.432 --> 00:00:22.841
When Peter's ball got stuck in a tree, Jeffrey got it down.

4
00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:25.684
"Thanks, Jeffrey," Peter said.

5
00:00:25.685 --> 00:00:29.086
"Oh, you're welcome, Peter," said Jeffrey.

6
00:00:29.087 --> 00:00:33.229
When Mary hurt herself, Jeffrey carried her home.

7
00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:37.254
"Oh my leg!" cried Mary.

8
00:00:37.255 --> 00:00:40.840
"Are you okay? Here, let me help you up.

9
00:00:40.841 --> 00:00:43.264
I'll take you home," said Jeffrey.

10
00:00:43.265 --> 00:00:46.330
"Thanks, Jeffrey," said Mary.

11
00:00:46.331 --> 00:00:49.771
Jeffrey liked to help his friends.

12
00:00:49.772 --> 00:00:56.130
But it was hard for Jeffrey to play with them.

13
00:00:56.131 --> 00:01:00.167
The hiding spots for hide-and-seek were too small.

14
00:01:00.168 --> 00:01:04.804
The jump rope was too short.

15
00:01:04.805 --> 00:01:08.157
The basketball hoop was too low.

16
00:01:08.158 --> 00:01:15.548
The seesaw always went up, but it never came down.

17
00:01:15.549 --> 00:01:19.308
One day Jeffrey left the playground.

18
00:01:19.309 --> 00:01:23.463
He sat down under the biggest tree he could find.

19
00:01:23.464 --> 00:01:28.376
"I am too big to play with my friends," he said to himself.

20
00:01:28.377 --> 00:01:30.493
Jeffrey was sad.

21
00:01:30.494 --> 00:01:35.007
He lowered his head and cried.

22
00:01:35.008 --> 00:01:37.279
"Hi, my name is Eddy.

23
00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:38.774
I'm new here.

24
00:01:38.775 --> 00:01:41.688
Do you want to play with me?" said a voice.

25
00:01:41.689 --> 00:01:44.101
Jeffrey didn't look up.

26
00:01:44.102 --> 00:01:48.133
"I'm too big to play with anyone," he cried.

27
00:01:48.134 --> 00:01:51.669
"I don't think you're that big," said Eddy.

28
00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.583
"Really?" asked Jeffrey.

29
00:01:54.584 --> 00:01:59.193
"Yes, really," said Eddy. "You're big like me."

30
00:01:59.194 --> 00:02:01.743
Jeffrey looked up hopefully.

31
00:02:01.744 --> 00:02:04.121
Eddy was an elephant!

32
00:02:04.122 --> 00:02:09.559
"Hi," said Jeffrey surprised. "My name is Jeffrey."

33
00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:13.755
Eddy smiled. "Why were you crying, Jeffrey?"

34
00:02:13.756 --> 00:02:19.407
"I was crying because I am too big to play with my friends," said Jeffrey.

35
00:02:19.408 --> 00:02:22.487
"You're not too big," said Eddy.

36
00:02:22.488 --> 00:02:26.054
"Let's go to the playground together and I'll show you."

37
00:02:26.055 --> 00:02:31.890
At the playground, Eddy showed Jeffrey new games to play with his friends.

38
00:02:31.891 --> 00:02:36.004
All the children climbed on one side of the seesaw.

39
00:02:36.005 --> 00:02:40.637
They all climbed on Jeffrey like a mountain.

40
00:02:40.638 --> 00:02:46.889
Jeffrey and Eddy became best friends, and they had fun with the other children.

41
00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:53.598
But Jeffrey was glad to have such a big friend too.
